{"assignees":[{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTU2OTMy","login":"i5hi","name":"ishi","databaseId":20156932}],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODAwMjcy","is_bot":false,"login":"BullishNode","name":"Bullish Node"},"body":"This bounty is for bdk-flutter but will also be used for lwk-dart and boltz-dart\r\n\r\nAll builds are currently functional but not reproducible/verifiable.\r\n\r\n**Requirements:**\r\n\r\nAndroid & Linux:  A build environment using bash scripts, makefile and Docker, that builds on Linux & Mac hosts\r\niOS & MacOS: A build environment using bash scripts and makefile, that builds on Mac hosts\r\nReproducibility: A bash (and python?) script that can verify github releases against local builds.\r\n\r\nThe library developers will be publishing binaries as github releases. We require a validation script that compares the libary's github release and compare them against local builds. Reference: https://github.com/signalapp/Signal-Android/blob/main/reproducible-builds%2FREADME.md\r\n\r\n**Skills:**\r\n\r\nYou do not need to write or debug any rust. All the library code works and compiles fine natively. The challenge here is in cross-compilation and creating reproducible builds.\r\nYou are free to use your toolchain of choice (zig?) as long as it is reproducible.\r\n\r\nBounty:\r\n0.03 BTC ($2000)\r\n\r\nFunding: BULLBITCOIN.COM \r\n\r\nYour work will be enabling the ethos of \"Dont trust, verify\" for critical bitcoin infrastructure.\r\n\r\nTo claim the bounty, submit a pull request to this repository. Pull requests will be evaluated on a first-come first-serve basis. The bounty will be allocated after review and confirmation that code quality is sufficient and functional. ","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl8560bxR","author":{"login":"i5hi"},"authorAssociation":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Scripts that work for the most part can be found here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/tree/22e0a276dcfe121df382a863a6fe616de79a61a5/rust\r\n","createdAt":"2024-04-17T07:27:10Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"EYES","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-2060565585","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl85--yaM","author":{"login":"hkarani"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hello @BullishNode and @i5hi. I'd like to make a contribution. Is this bounty still alive? ","createdAt":"2024-05-24T21:30:13Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-2130388620","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl85_HvPH","author":{"login":"i5hi"},"authorAssociation":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Hey @hkarani. Sorry, someone has already started work on this :/ \r\n\r\n@BullishNode I'm closing this!","createdAt":"2024-05-27T06:29:40Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-2132734919","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl85_IalZ","author":{"login":"hkarani"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@i5hi \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI had actually COMPLETED all the work. Took around 3 weeks. It's all [here](https://github.com/hkarani/bdk-flutter-reproducible-build). \r\n\r\nMy bad, I had the expectation that if it was open it'd be free for anyone to submit a bounty.\r\n\r\nThe code there works. It does a byte by byte binary check of the binaries to check for reproducibility. \r\n\r\nThe contributor can use the code if they find it useful in their submission.","createdAt":"2024-05-27T08:16:45Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"HEART","users":{"totalCount":1}},{"content":"EYES","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-2132912473","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl85_LoOK","author":{"login":"i5hi"},"authorAssociation":"COLLABORATOR","body":"okay! great! i will review this over the week and keep you in the loop. we will work something out ;)","createdAt":"2024-05-27T15:56:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"LAUGH","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-2133754762","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl85_Lu_H","author":{"login":"i5hi"},"authorAssociation":"COLLABORATOR","body":"when you said - 'I'd like to make a contribution';  I thought you meant, you would like to give it a shot! :P \r\n\r\nLooks like you have something very complete here! Definately more work has gone into this than the current contributor who we just proposed to take it up last week. \r\n\r\nI'm running a quick test right now for android, will test and review everything over the coming week. I will also try this against lwk and boltz, and if anything additional is needed for that I will let you know.\r\n\r\nConsidering that you've already put so much work into it, I will ask the other dev to stop working on it and we will build on what you have.\r\n","createdAt":"2024-05-27T16:11:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-2133782471","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl85_Lxwz","author":{"login":"i5hi"},"authorAssociation":"COLLABORATOR","body":"```\r\n./verifier.sh: line 64: [: missing `]'\r\nFiles match in size\r\n./verifier.sh: line 94: [: missing `]'\r\n✅ Success! The binaries are byte by byte identical✅.\r\n```\r\n\r\n","createdAt":"2024-05-27T16:20:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-2133793843","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl85_PW5Z","author":{"login":"hkarani"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I think I can fix this by adding Shellcheck github action for POSIX compliance and running some more test.","createdAt":"2024-05-28T09:17:24Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-2134732377","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl85_ROUv","author":{"login":"BullishNode"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"thank you for the PR! ","createdAt":"2024-05-28T13:28:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"HOORAY","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-2135221551","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl85_h-KV","author":{"login":"hkarani"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@i5hi Closing these [issues](https://github.com/hkarani/bdk-flutter-reproducible-build/issues) will polish what currently exists.\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n","createdAt":"2024-05-30T13:54:28Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-2139611797","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl86Iuo3T","author":{"login":"hkarani"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@i5hi Pinged you on Telegram.","createdAt":"2024-08-16T17:58:51Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-2293927379","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl86gDaVD","author":{"login":"hkarani"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hello @i5hi, I reverse-engineered Cargokit to build binaries locally and also added a bunch of features such as unified platform builds and builds for specific library versions.\n\nI'll share this to see who wants try it out and offer feedback on how it can be improved.\n\nPlease check it out here https://github.com/hkarani/bdk-flutter-reproducible-build","createdAt":"2025-02-26T14:41:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-2685248835","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl86lvwfL","author":{"login":"hkarani"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@i5hi pinged you on telegram","createdAt":"2025-04-05T14:31:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-2780760011","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl87qvZCm","author":{"login":"FraktalDeFiDAO"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Claiming this bounty and starting execution now.\\n\\nPlanned delivery:\\n1) Reproducible cross-compilation pipeline for Android/Linux (Linux + macOS hosts) and iOS/macOS (macOS host).\\n2) Deterministic verification script to compare local artifacts against GitHub release binaries.\\n3) Build docs + reproducibility checklist + CI validation notes.\\n\\nI will post progress checkpoints with test evidence as milestones are completed.","createdAt":"2026-02-21T06:38:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-3938291878","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl88AAAABB0MddQ","author":{"login":"KingParmenides"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted PR #5 for this bounty: https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/pull/5\n\nIt adds a Cargokit `reproduce-binaries` command plus Linux/Android Docker wrappers and macOS/iOS bash/make wrappers to rebuild and byte-compare signed GitHub release assets.\n\nPayout BTC address: 39Q34P8A7g375yqEr8buvNJkUbRgKfbKQZ","createdAt":"2026-05-11T00:45:07Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-4416806261","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl88AAAABB0Norw","author":{"login":"KingParmenides"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Follow-up for the same reproducible-build bounty: I also opened companion PRs for the two sibling libraries named in this issue:\n\n- lwk-dart: https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/lwk-dart/pull/72\n- boltz-dart: https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/boltz-dart/pull/48\n\nTogether with bdk-flutter PR #5, this gives all three libraries the same Cargokit `reproduce-binaries` verifier and platform wrappers.","createdAt":"2026-05-11T00:51:54Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-4416825519","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl88AAAABB0OQuQ","author":{"login":"KingParmenides"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Small follow-up: I updated all three PR branches to include an explicit `reproducible_builds/makefile` with `darwin`, `linux`, and `android` targets, and documented the `make -f reproducible_builds/makefile ...` entrypoints. That makes the bash/make/Docker workflow consistent across bdk-flutter, lwk-dart, and boltz-dart.","createdAt":"2026-05-11T00:55:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-4416835769","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl88AAAABB0OxCw","author":{"login":"KingParmenides"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Added one more documentation pass to all three PRs: each `reproducible_builds/README.md` now includes a maintainer release checklist covering signing key generation, GitHub Actions secret handling, `rust/cargokit.yaml` public-key setup, CI artifact publishing notes, and independent verifier commands.","createdAt":"2026-05-11T00:58:39Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-4416844043","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl88AAAABB8Amsg","author":{"login":"hkarani"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@KingParmenides Which published pre-compiled binaries have you been able to reproduce?","createdAt":"2026-05-11T20:40:51Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-4425000626","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOLLIIl88AAAABGAL_iw","author":{"login":"i5hi"},"authorAssociation":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Not accepting any new entries for this bounty as @hkarani has already completed and claimed half the bounty for android. \n\nAnd now @KingParmenides @FraktalDeFiDAO @mudaly10-coder have also started working on it. \n\nWill follow up with you guys over the coming weeks. Please include steps to test and reproduce in your PRs.","createdAt":"2026-06-13T07:04:43Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1#issuecomment-4697816971","viewerDidAuthor":false}],"createdAt":"2024-04-16T20:50:12Z","labels":[],"state":"OPEN","title":"Bounty for reproducible cross-compilation of rust libraries for Android, Linux, Ios and Macos targets - 0.03 BTC ($2000)","updatedAt":"2026-06-24T14:24:25Z","url":"https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/bdk-flutter/issues/1"}
